#: ../../site/examples.md:1
msgid "Examples and demos"
msgstr "示例与演示"

#: ../../site/examples.md:3
msgid ""
"Two kinds of runnable material live in the repository: small programs that "
"show the API in use, and benchmark harnesses that measure it. Everything "
"here builds from the same checkout; none of it downloads data."
msgstr "仓库里有两类可运行材料：展示 API 用法的小程序，以及测量它的基准。它们都用同一份检出构建；都不会下载数据。"

#: ../../site/examples.md:7
msgid "Render a factor report"
msgstr "渲染一份因子报表"

#: ../../site/examples.md:9
msgid ""
"`examples/render_factor_report.cpp` builds a synthetic factor panel, "
"analyses it and writes three artefacts: an English HTML report, a Chinese "
"HTML report and an XLSX workbook. It shows the shortest path from prepared "
"data to a rendered document."
msgstr ""
"`examples/render_factor_report.cpp` 构建一个合成因子面板、分析它，并写出三个产物：英文 HTML 报表、中文 "
"HTML 报表与 XLSX 工作簿。它展示了从准备好的数据到渲染文档的最短路径。"

#: ../../site/examples.md:14
msgid ""
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_report_render\n"
"./build/fincore_report_render report.html\n"
"# writes report.html, report.zh.html and report.xlsx\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_report_render\n"
"./build/fincore_report_render report.html\n"
"# writes report.html, report.zh.html and report.xlsx\n"

#: ../../site/examples.md:20
msgid ""
"Pass `--echarts` to render the charts with the embedded ECharts build "
"instead of inline SVG:"
msgstr "传 `--echarts` 可用内嵌 ECharts 渲染图表，而不是内联 SVG："

#: ../../site/examples.md:23
msgid "./build/fincore_report_render --echarts report.html\n"
msgstr "./build/fincore_report_render --echarts report.html\n"

#: ../../site/examples.md:27
msgid ""
"The report is deterministic: rendering the same document twice produces "
"identical bytes, which is what makes the files safe to diff and hash."
msgstr "报表是确定性的：同一文档渲染两次得到相同字节，这正是文件可以安全比较与哈希的原因。"

#: ../../site/examples.md:30
msgid "Render one document through every backend"
msgstr "用所有后端渲染同一份文档"

#: ../../site/examples.md:32
msgid ""
"`examples/render_iteration8_artifacts.cpp` takes a directory and writes the "
"same document as HTML (inline SVG and ECharts), XLSX, Plotly JSON, Bokeh "
"JSON and PDF, then prints the document's semantic digest."
msgstr ""
"`examples/render_iteration8_artifacts.cpp` 接收一个目录，把同一份文档写成 HTML（内联 SVG 与 "
"ECharts）、XLSX、Plotly JSON、Bokeh JSON 与 PDF，然后打印文档的语义摘要。"

#: ../../site/examples.md:36
msgid ""
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_i8_artifacts\n"
"./build/fincore_i8_artifacts ./out\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_i8_artifacts\n"
"./build/fincore_i8_artifacts ./out\n"

#: ../../site/examples.md:41
msgid ""
"The digest depends only on the document, not on the backend, so the six "
"files can be compared against a recorded digest even though their formats "
"differ."
msgstr "摘要只取决于文档，与后端无关，因此这六个文件即使格式不同，也可以对照一个记录好的摘要。"

#: ../../site/examples.md:44
msgid "An interactive ImPlot dashboard"
msgstr "交互式 ImPlot 仪表盘"

#: ../../site/examples.md:46
msgid ""
"`examples/implot_dashboard.cpp` draws the tear charts, frontier, heatmap and"
" event panels in an ImGui/ImPlot window. It is built only when the GUI "
"options are on and the GUI dependencies are present:"
msgstr ""
"`examples/implot_dashboard.cpp` 在 ImGui/ImPlot 窗口中绘制 "
"tears、前沿、热力图与事件面板。只有开启图形选项且图形依赖存在时才会构建："

#: ../../site/examples.md:50
msgid ""
"cmake -S . -B build-gui -DFINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON "
"-DFINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT_DEMO=ON\n"
"cmake --build build-gui --parallel --target fincore_implot_demo\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake -S . -B build-gui -DFINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON "
"-DFINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT_DEMO=ON\n"
"cmake --build build-gui --parallel --target fincore_implot_demo\n"

