msgid ""
"examples/        report rendering and dashboard demos\n"
"benchmarks/      factor and alpha003 workloads, plus the Python drivers\n"
"tests/           unit, consumer and oracle tests\n"
msgstr ""
"examples/        report rendering and dashboard demos\n"
"benchmarks/      factor and alpha003 workloads, plus the Python drivers\n"
"tests/           unit, consumer and oracle tests\n"

#: ../../site/examples.md:88
msgid ""
"Every example is a normal consumer of the installed library: it includes "
"`<fincore/...>` headers and links `fincore::fincore`, so it also serves as a"
" compile-time check that the public surface is usable from outside the build"
" tree."
msgstr ""
"每个示例都是已安装库的普通消费者：它包含 `<fincore/...>` 头文件并链接 `fincore::fincore`，因此它同时是一次编译期检查"
" —— 公共接口在构建树之外可用。"

